WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 5da11fa63c77f04329255ba0ae3d5fdf

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.480
Karibu tena. Kwa hiyo sasa unajua jinsi ya

00:00:02.540 --> 00:00:05.300
kuunda dictionary na kupata thamani kutoka

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.840
ndani yake. Lakini nini kinatokea kama data ikibadilika?

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.760
Wakati fulani, nitakuwa mzee zaidi.

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.060
Sitakuwa 42, nitakuwa 43.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.160
Tunasasishaje dictionary? Basi,

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.000
tunatumia njia inayofanana sana na ile

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.600
tunayotumia kupata kitu. Unajua kwamba tunapata kitu

00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:22.860
kwa kutumia mabano ya mraba kutoa thamani.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.980
Basi, tunaweza pia kutumia mabano ya mraba yakifuatiwa

00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:29.980
na alama ya sawa kusasisha dictionary.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:32.920
Jiki anaenda kwenye sanduku la person, anatoa

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:36.370
ukurasa wa daftari, anatafuta funguo age, na

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:38.560
kisha anafuta 42 iliyokuwa hapo

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.200
na kuandika 43 mahali pake, na kisha

00:00:41.780 --> 00:00:43.089
ukurasa wa daftari unarudi ndani ya

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:47.800
sanduku. Hapa tunabadilisha dictionary yenyewe. Jiki

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:50.880
hafanyi dictionary mpya, anabadilisha

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:54.420
daftari lililokuwa tayari ndani ya sanduku. Vipi

00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.310
kama unataka kuongeza taarifa ambazo

00:00:56.400 --> 00:00:59.530
hazikuwepo awali? Basi, unaweza kufanya

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.160
kitu kile kile. Ukitaja funguo

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:04.900
ambayo haipo, Jiki ataongeza tu

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:07.340
funguo mpya chini kabisa na thamani hiyo.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.200
Kwa hiyo katika kesi hii, atafungua daftari,

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:13.140
atatafuta country, ataona haipo, na

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.680
kisha ataongeza mstari mpya chini,

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.880
country upande wa kushoto, England upande wa kulia.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:20.580
Kwa hiyo sintaksia ile ile kama tunavyobadilisha

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:24.320
thamani. Jiki hushughulikia vyote viwili kiotomatiki. Kama funguo

00:01:24.360 --> 00:01:27.660
ipo, anaisasisha. Kama haipo,

00:01:27.740 --> 00:01:29.290
anaiongeza. Huna haja ya kufanya lolote

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:33.040
la pekee. Na kama vile unavyoweza kuanza

00:01:33.080 --> 00:01:35.120
na orodha tupu na kuongeza vitu ndani yake,

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:37.240
unaweza kuanza na dictionary tupu na kuongeza

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.340
funguo moja baada ya nyingine. Tena, huo ni

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.260
mtindo unaotumika sana. Utauona kila wakati.

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.860
Matumizi moja ya kawaida ya dictionary ni

00:01:45.940 --> 00:01:49.260
kuhesabu vitu. Unaweza kutumia funguo

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:50.720
kama vitu tunavyotaka kuhesabu

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.360
na thamani kama idadi yake. Kwa hiyo

00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.800
fikiria unatazama ndege na unataka

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:57.780
kufuatilia ni ndege wangapi wa kila aina

00:01:57.820 --> 00:02:00.180
umewaona. Kila unapomwona ndege,

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.740
unaweka idadi yake kuwa moja, na kila

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.480
unapomwona tena, unapata

00:02:04.540 --> 00:02:07.160
thamani yake ya sasa na kuiongeza kwa moja.

00:02:07.200 --> 00:02:08.800
Ili mtindo huu ufanye kazi, tunahitaji njia

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:11.220
ya kukagua kama dictionary tayari ina funguo hiyo,

00:02:11.300 --> 00:02:13.320
na kama inayo, tunaongeza moja,

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.260
au kama haina funguo hiyo,

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:18.480
tunahitaji kuianza na moja.

00:02:19.560 --> 00:02:21.250
Na ili kufanya hivyo, tuna

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:25.380
metodu kwenye dictionary, metodu ya has (kuwa na). Unataja

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.520
funguo unayovutiwa nayo, na Jiki

00:02:27.560 --> 00:02:30.060
atakagua kama dictionary ina funguo hiyo

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:33.020
au la, kisha arejeshe kweli au sikweli kulingana na hilo.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:36.210
Kuna mazoezi kadhaa yanayokuja sasa

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:38.480
yatakayotumia yote haya. Kila la heri

00:02:38.520 --> 00:02:39.800
nayo, na tutaonana hapa tena

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:40.130
hivi karibuni.
